### ============================================================
### SmartLogistic — Demo Flow (HTTP Client)
### ============================================================
### Use: VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### Steps: 1. Register → 2. Login → save token → 3. Use token on protected endpoints
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@authToken = <insert-token-from-login>

### ============================================================
### 1. Registrar Usuario
### POST /api/auth/register (público)
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operador1",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "OPERATOR"
}

### ============================================================
### 2. Login — Obtener JWT
### POST /api/auth/login (público)
### ============================================================
### @name login
### Copy the token value and set @authToken above

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operador1",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ============================================================
### 3. Validar Token (uso interno Nginx)
### POST /api/auth/validate (público)
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================================
### 4. Crear Orden de Despacho (protegido)
### POST /api/orders
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-ELEC-001",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "sku": "SKU-CRISTAL-001",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### ============================================================
### 5. Consultar Orden Creada (protegido)
### GET /api/orders/{id}
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================================
### 6. Asignar Robot Válido (protegido)
### POST /api/orders/{id}/assign-robot
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/assign-robot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "robotId": "RBT-01"
}

### ============================================================
### 7. Asignar Robot con Batería Baja (debe rechazar)
### POST /api/orders/{id}/assign-robot
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/assign-robot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "robotId": "RBT-LOW"
}

### ============================================================
### 8. Calcular Ruta (Dijkstra) (protegido)
### POST /api/orders/{id}/route-plan
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/route-plan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "algorithm": "DIJKSTRA"
}

### ============================================================
### 9. Completar Ruta (protegido)
### POST /api/routes/{id}/complete
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/routes/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "robotId": "RBT-01",
  "durationSeconds": 420
}

### ============================================================
### 10. Consultar Stock por SKU (protegido)
### GET /api/inventory/items/{sku}/spots
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/SKU-ELEC-001/spots
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================================
### 11. Consultar Grafo del Almacén (protegido)
### GET /api/warehouse/graph
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/graph
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================================
### 12. Sin JWT — debe dar 401 (protegido)
### GET /api/orders
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### ============================================================
### 13. Health Check (directo a MS-Identity)
### ============================================================

GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/health

### ============================================================
### 14. Métricas Prometheus (directo a MS-Identity)
### ============================================================

GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/prometheus
